{"real": true, "dur": 53.48, "sent": [{"start": 0.2, "end": 11.88, "text": "In the 1970s, the applied linguist David Wilkins argued that a syllabus should cover the meanings and functions learners need to express, alongside the grammar.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 0.2}, {"w": "the", "s": 0.3}, {"w": "1970s,", "s": 0.42}, {"w": "the", "s": 1.94}, {"w": "applied", "s": 2.06}, {"w": "linguist", "s": 2.5}, {"w": "David", "s": 3.08}, {"w": "Wilkins", "s": 3.44}, {"w": "argued", "s": 4.44}, {"w": "that", "s": 4.92}, {"w": "a", "s": 5.5}, {"w": "syllabus", "s": 5.62}, {"w": "should", "s": 6.24}, {"w": "cover", "s": 6.56}, {"w": "the", "s": 6.96}, {"w": "meanings", "s": 7.1}, {"w": "and", "s": 7.54}, {"w": "functions", "s": 7.76}, {"w": "learners", "s": 8.8}, {"w": "need", "s": 9.26}, {"w": "to", "s": 9.46}, {"w": "express,", "s": 9.66}, {"w": "alongside", "s": 10.72}, {"w": "the", "s": 11.34}, {"w": "grammar.", "s": 11.48}]}, {"start": 12.66, "end": 14.36, "text": "FluOLinGo uses both.", "words": [{"w": "FluOLinGo", "s": 12.66}, {"w": "uses", "s": 13.6}, {"w": "both.", "s": 14.0}]}, {"start": 14.86, "end": 17.56, "text": "Linguistic goals are about the language itself.", "words": [{"w": "Linguistic", "s": 14.86}, {"w": "goals", "s": 15.44}, {"w": "are", "s": 15.88}, {"w": "about", "s": 16.059}, {"w": "the", "s": 16.379}, {"w": "language", "s": 16.54}, {"w": "itself.", "s": 17.02}]}, {"start": 18.18, "end": 24.2, "text": "Communicative goals are about what you do with it, like saying what you like or inviting a friend out.", "words": [{"w": "Communicative", "s": 18.18}, {"w": "goals", "s": 18.98}, {"w": "are", "s": 19.4}, {"w": "about", "s": 19.64}, {"w": "what", "s": 19.92}, {"w": "you", "s": 20.12}, {"w": "do", "s": 20.36}, {"w": "with", "s": 20.54}, {"w": "it,", "s": 20.74}, {"w": "like", "s": 21.16}, {"w": "saying", "s": 21.44}, {"w": "what", "s": 21.7}, {"w": "you", "s": 21.86}, {"w": "like", "s": 22.02}, {"w": "or", "s": 22.62}, {"w": "inviting", "s": 22.94}, {"w": "a", "s": 23.46}, {"w": "friend", "s": 23.58}, {"w": "out.", "s": 23.92}]}, {"start": 24.74, "end": 33.74, "text": "Later frameworks, like the CEFR, went further and distinguished between sounds, vocabulary, grammar and writing.", "words": [{"w": "Later", "s": 24.74}, {"w": "frameworks,", "s": 25.1}, {"w": "like", "s": 26.14}, {"w": "the", "s": 26.3}, {"w": "CEFR,", "s": 26.48}, {"w": "went", "s": 27.94}, {"w": "further", "s": 28.24}, {"w": "and", "s": 28.72}, {"w": "distinguished", "s": 28.88}, {"w": "between", "s": 30.04}, {"w": "sounds,", "s": 30.48}, {"w": "vocabulary,", "s": 31.36}, {"w": "grammar", "s": 32.5}, {"w": "and", "s": 33.1}, {"w": "writing.", "s": 33.26}]}, {"start": 34.18, "end": 43.88, "text": "In this talk, I split grammar into two: word forms, like verb endings, and sentence structure, like word order.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 34.18}, {"w": "this", "s": 34.34}, {"w": "talk,", "s": 34.56}, {"w": "I", "s": 35.48}, {"w": "split", "s": 35.7}, {"w": "grammar", "s": 36.04}, {"w": "into", "s": 36.56}, {"w": "two:", "s": 36.88}, {"w": "word", "s": 38.02}, {"w": "forms,", "s": 38.3}, {"w": "like", "s": 39.52}, {"w": "verb", "s": 39.82}, {"w": "endings,", "s": 40.16}, {"w": "and", "s": 41.3}, {"w": "sentence", "s": 41.56}, {"w": "structure,", "s": 42.0}, {"w": "like", "s": 42.92}, {"w": "word", "s": 43.22}, {"w": "order.", "s": 43.54}]}, {"start": 44.32, "end": 52.7, "text": "So I end up with five types of linguistic goal: sounds, vocabulary, word forms, sentence structure and script.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 44.32}, {"w": "I", "s": 44.78}, {"w": "end", "s": 44.88}, {"w": "up", "s": 45.06}, {"w": "with", "s": 45.18}, {"w": "five", "s": 45.4}, {"w": "types", "s": 45.7}, {"w": "of", "s": 45.96}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 46.08}, {"w": "goal:", "s": 46.64}, {"w": "sounds,", "s": 47.36}, {"w": "vocabulary,", "s": 48.28}, {"w": "word", "s": 49.52}, {"w": "forms,", "s": 49.86}, {"w": "sentence", "s": 50.72}, {"w": "structure", "s": 51.16}, {"w": "and", "s": 51.98}, {"w": "script.", "s": 52.28}]}]}